      "body": "{\"prefix\":\"\",\"limit\":100,\"offset\":0,\"sortBy\":{\"column\":\"name\",\"order\":\"asc\"}}",
      "note": "no policy lets an anon key see these rows, and what a listing does about that is a different question from what a download does"
